+{{template "task-listing" .Tasks}}
+{{range .Bodies}}
+### {{.ID}}
+{{template "task-body" .Body}}
+{{end}}{{if .SpecRecorded}}
+## Spec — what this set was asked to do
+{{.Spec}}
+{{end}}
+## Respond with the report and nothing else
+Write the report as Markdown, starting at a `## ` heading. No preamble, no sign-off.
